{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00233",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.23,
      "end_seconds": 6.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Hi there, is it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.62,
      "end_seconds": 13.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.3,
      "end_seconds": 22.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "Well, I've been having pain in the lower right tummy. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.95,
      "end_seconds": 29.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "How long have you had it? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.11,
      "end_seconds": 33.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Probably three days. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.0,
      "end_seconds": 43.27,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.11,
      "end_seconds": 54.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.79,
      "text": "It, It settles a little with lying still. It's severe, honestly. It sort of comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.04,
      "end_seconds": 63.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.94,
      "end_seconds": 72.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get nausea as well. The nausea? That's been for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.41,
      "end_seconds": 75.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Let's do your observations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.83,
      "end_seconds": 87.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.21,
      "end_seconds": 115.31,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "Okay: height 170 centimetres, pulse is 98 beats a minute. And pressure 112 over 67, temp 38.7 degrees, weight 68 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.01,
      "end_seconds": 119.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.97,
      "end_seconds": 124.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.8,
      "end_seconds": 129.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "If you're comfortable, I'll examine you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.35,
      "end_seconds": 132.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.08,
      "end_seconds": 153.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "There's tenderness in the right lower part and it hurts when I let go suddenly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.36,
      "end_seconds": 156.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.52,
      "end_seconds": 173.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Bowel sounds are present."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.66,
      "end_seconds": 183.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up. Have you had any blood in the stool, hernia bulge or jaundice?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.02,
      "end_seconds": 192.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Well, no blood in the stool, hernia bulge or jaundice, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.23,
      "end_seconds": 198.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.79,
      "end_seconds": 204.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.36,
      "end_seconds": 218.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Are there any allergies on your record that I should check?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.95,
      "end_seconds": 226.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "No allergies that I know of, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.65,
      "end_seconds": 236.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.54,
      "end_seconds": 242.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "No, um, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.8,
      "end_seconds": 255.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "And your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.71,
      "end_seconds": 262.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "I drive a delivery van all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.95,
      "end_seconds": 266.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Who do you live with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.27,
      "end_seconds": 274.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "I live with my family, my husband and two kids."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.37,
      "end_seconds": 277.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "How's your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.74,
      "end_seconds": 281.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "I'm mostly vegetarian."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.11,
      "end_seconds": 294.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.27,
      "end_seconds": 298.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.0,
      "end_seconds": 304.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like possible appendicitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.61,
      "end_seconds": 329.02,
      "duration_seconds": 17.41,
      "text": "I think blood tests makes sense here, for abdominal pain. Please don't eat or drink anything until the surgeons have seen you. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. See me again after the scan."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.08,
      "end_seconds": 334.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I'll make the appointment on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.5,
      "end_seconds": 345.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.17,
      "end_seconds": 352.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "So, I come back after the scan. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.03,
      "end_seconds": 361.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.26,
      "end_seconds": 364.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.06,
      "end_seconds": 366.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Safe journey home."
    }
  ]
}